n\nSecurity\n\nPark\n\nReserved Parking\n\nService/Goods Lift\n\nIntercom Facility\n\nMaintenance Staff\n\nGymnasium\n\nView All Amenitites (23)\n\nProject Details\n\nAbout Ajmera Pristine\n\nAjmera Pristine is a Ready To Move project by Ajmera Group in Borivali West Mumbai, offering 3 BHK Flats configuration. Below are the key details of Ajmera Pristine.\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Ajmera Pristine Price | Rs. 3.65 Cr Onwards |\n| Ajmera Pristine Status | Ready To Move |\n| Ajmera Pristine Launch Date | 01 December 2008 |\n| Ajmera Pristine Possession Date | 01 November 2016 |\n| Towers in Ajmera Pristine | 3 |\n\nAjmera Pristine in Borivali West, Mumbai, is a perfect option if you're looking for a premium property within the price range of Rs. 3.65 Cr Onwards. Developed by Ajmera Group, the project reflects quality construction and reliability. At present, the project is in the Ready To Move stage. It covers an area of 2 Acre. The project offers 252 units.  \n  \nThere are 3 towers planned within the project. The official launch date for the project was December 2008.The commencement certificate of Ajmera Pristine has been granted. You can reach out to this project at Shop No.5, Building No. D/28, Yogi Vihar, Near Ajmera Global School, Eksar Road, Borivali West. The required pincode of the project is 400092. Each unit is designed with Piped Gas, Internet/Wi-Fi Connectivity, Intercom Facility, Air Conditioned, Vaastu Compliant facilities. The development features key amenities including Lift, Water Storage, Power Back Up, DTH Television Facility, Reserved Parking and more. It also offers amenities like Kids Club, Indoor Squash & Badminton Courts, Kids Play Area, Indoor Games Room, among others. According to 2 user ratings and 1 user reviews, Ajmera Pristine is rated 4.21/5. If you are planning to buy through a home loan, the estimated EMI comes to around Rs. 1.7 Lac/month for a tenure of 30 years. As of today, 2 properties are listed for sale by owners and dealers, providing multiple options to explore. Dotom Hilton, Kalpataru Advay, Inspira Aura, Nicco Vanashri, IM The Crimson are nearby under-construction housing projects. You will find ready-to-move societies like Shraddha Elite, Shanti Ashram, Paradigm Ananda Residency, Garden Grove Phase 2, Saath NHP W 92 in the surrounding area.  \n  \n\n### Ajmera Pristine Floor Plan\n\n| Unit Configuration | Unit Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| Ajmera Pristine 3 BHK Flat | 1665 Sq. Ft. |\n\nFloor plans tell you exactly how big or small the rooms or spaces in a house are, and so are the perfect way to get an understanding of the house layoutThere are 1 configurations in 1 different types of layouts across the different properties in Ajmera Pristine. Bathrooms and balconies are a part of these configurations. You can view differnt configurations across unit sizes of Ajmera Pristine on Magicbricks.  \n  \n\n### Ajmera Pristine Brochure\n\nGet a comprehensive and detailed overview of Ajmera Pristine by downloading their PDF BrochureThe brochure is accessible from the top right end of the page, under the link 'Download Brochure'To view the Ajmera Pristine brochure PDF, fill in your details like name, contact number, and email ID.  \n  \n\n### How is the Borivali West Real Estate Market?\n\nIn the July 2026 quarter, multistorey apartments in Borivali West are priced at an average of Rs. 25,004/sq. ft, while the broader price bracket lies between Rs. 18,991 and Rs. 31,016/sq. ft, attracting a mix of buyers and investors. The current rental yield in Borivali West, Mumbai for residential properties stands at 2.96%. Going by 376 reviews shared by residents, Borivali West maintains a rating of 4.16/5.For a mix of shopping and fun, you can check out Maxus Cinemas and Zoom Plaza Mall. MKVV and St. Francis Institute of Technology are among the trusted schools available within walking distance of the project.\n\nProject Summary is Ai Generated\n\nKey Highlights\n\nAmenities\n\nClub House\n\n★\n\nPrivate Te