BHK Apartment  1665 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 4.43 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nAjmera Pristine's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Ajmera Pristine | Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 38350 | 30900 |\n| Mar 2026 | 37950 | 31300 |\n| Dec 2025 | 31350 | 30300 |\n| Sep 2025 | 30500 | 30350 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nAjmera Pristine avg. price is ₹ 38.4 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Borivali West at ₹ 30.9 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| Current Project **Ajmera Pristine** | ₹ 38,350 |\n| [Hiranandani Heritage](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/hiranandani-heritage/3539/project \"Hiranandani Heritage\") | ₹ 36,350 |\n| [Hiranandani Heritage Rivona](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/hiranandani-heritage-rivona/26823/project \"Hiranandani Heritage Rivona\") | ₹ 36,350 |\n| Borivali West | ₹ 30,900 |\n| [Chandak Eden Garden](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-eden-garden/26653/project \"Chandak Eden Garden\") | ₹ 29,900 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Borivali West ranges from ₹ 22.1 K to ₹ 74.4 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Ajmera Pristine | In Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 32.7 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 45.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 74.4 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Ajmera Pristine.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nA total of 3 residential transactions has been registered so far for Ajmera Pristine, amounting to ₹ 7 Cr till September 2026.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Ajmera Pristine moved from ₹ 37,950/sqft to ₹ 38,350/sqft, reflecting a 1.05% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Ajmera Pristine moved from ₹ 31,350/sqft to ₹ 37,950/sqft, reflecting a 21.05% rise.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Ajmera Pristine moved from ₹ 30,500/sqft to ₹ 31,350/sqft, reflecting a 2.79% rise.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n3 Sales Transactions Registered in Ajmera Pristine From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 27 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 | ₹ 7 Cr | ₹ 27,000 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Ajmera Pristine Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 1665 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Ajmera Pristine, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/ajmera-pristine-apartment-3bhk-1665sqft1.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 4.43 Cr\n\n## Top Experts in Mumbai\n\nMeet the top real estate experts for Ajmera Pristine, Mumbai.\n\n![Manoj Mahendra Pal]()\n\nGlobal Housing\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Ajmera Pristine\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Ajmera Pristine to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Ajmera Pristine Floor Plans](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ajmera-pristine-project-floor-plans1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Ajmera Pristine Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ajmera-pristine-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nDownload master plan of Ajmera Pristine to explore layout details in Borivali West, Mumbai.\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Ajmera Pristine\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-partyhal-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Ajmera Borivali West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Ajmera Pristine.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Ajmera Pristine](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ajmera-pristine-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### La Stella International Montessori\n\n#### Yogi Hotel\n\n#### Dr Kulkarni Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Borivali West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nWestern Express Highway & SV Road\n\nLimited social amenities and infrastructure\n\nBorivali West attracts me since my experiences feel subdued and balanced. Nearby markets daily and excellent schools are good. Weekend beach time and runs close to SGNP are something I like. Andheri and Goregaon are simple for me to work in. Parking problems and traffic jams call for quick solutions.\n\n— Suresh Sanghvi, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Ajmera Pristine\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n3 Sales Transactions Registered in Ajmera Pristine From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 27 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-03-26 | Floor 1, Unit 101 | 70, B | 1,100 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2026-03-12 | Floor 7, Unit 701 | 70, B | 1,100 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-11-19 | Floor 1, Unit 104 | 70, A | 882 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Ajmera Pristine compare with similar projects?\n\n![Ajmera Pristine project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ajmera-pristine-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Ajmera Pristine](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ajmera-pristine/2996/project \"Ajmera Pristine\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-the-wadhwa-aquaria-grande-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/the-wadhwa-aquaria-grande/3009/project \"The Wadhwa Aquaria Grande\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Hiranandani Heritage project in Kandivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-hiranandani-heritage-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Hiranandani Heritage](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/hiranandani-heritage/3539/project \"Hiranandani Heritage\")\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Ajmera Track Record\n\n![Ajmera logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/ajmera-420.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nAjmera Developers is one of the country’s most reputed and leading real estate companies and has experience of 47 years and the Ajmera Group has also diversified into other segments like vaults security, solar power, cement, sports and social welfare. The portfolio of Ajmera properties includes several projects in and around Mumbai in addition to Pune, Surat, Ahmedabad, Bangalore and Rajkot in addition to a global project at Bahrain. Ajmera Builders believes in innovation, quality, aesthetic appeal and comfort and has transformed into a major realty conglomerate in recent times. Why Ajmera? All Ajmera residential projects are developed by leading engineers and architects along with skilled professionals. The Group believes in core values like trust, integrity, transparency, aesthetic appeal, design excellence, functionality, comfort and customer satisfaction. The latter aspect is taken very seriously by the Group. The Group focuses on sustainable development and believes in trust, goodwill and long lasting customer relationships. The Group offers housing solutions for almost market segment. The Group offers world class housing propositions for customers at comparatively affordable and reasonable rates. The Group offers spacious housing solutions to customers along with premium amenities and facilities. The Group emphasizes hugely on project quality and adheres to stringent quality standards. The Group believes in seamless project execution and seeks to offer greater value propositions to its customers. Why Ajmera? There are several Ajmera projects that have become landmarks in their own right over the years and this tally also includes multiple Ajmera upcoming projects. A few of these are listed below: Ajmera Aeon- This premium project goes up to 49 storeys and offers premium 2, 3 and 4 BHK homes to buyers along with cutting edge contemporary amenities and facilities. The project has been planned by Singapore based Space Matrix architects. The project offers diverse facilities, clean renewable energy, the latest technological advancements and single access control for multiple facilities. This luxuriously designed project is located at Bhakti Park in WadalaNew Era- This project offers luxuriously designed 1 and 2 BHK new generation homes along with a nature friendly and pollution free living ambience. The pristine and lush green landscapes promise a visual treat while there are 18 storey towers containing almost all contemporary conveniences that you can think of Ajmera Villows- This novel residential project at Bangalore offers breath taking Mexican design inspired villas along with exclusive facilities and other amenities. The project comes with spectacular interiors, innovative and supremely functional floor plans, high ceilings and grand layouts. The project offers amenities like a fitness and spa centre, lounge, polyclinic, library, garden terrace, tennis and basketball courts, skating rink, jogging track, mini golf, swimming pool, cricket pitch and many more\n\n![Ajmera Vann residential project in Versova](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ajmera-vann-project-flagship-opt-9d7f1ce3-3949-4ddb-ad4e-3ce53baec8cb.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVersova, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.71 Cr to 12.00 Cr\n\n![Ajmera Solis residential project in Vikhroli East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ajmera-solis-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVikhroli East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment, Retail Shop\n\n₹ 1.10 Cr to 2.51 Cr\n\n![Ajmera 78 Lake Town residential project in Bhandup West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ajmera-78-lake-town-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBhandup West, Mumbai\n\n1 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 85.00 Lac to 91.73 Lac\n\n![Ajmera Shikhar residential project in Malad West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ajmera-shikhar-project-flagship-opt-b258a1e0-1371-4c03-a73f-d67c9ff9b0c8.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.01 Cr to 1.52 Cr\n\n![Ajmera Eden residential project in Ghatkopar East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ajmera-eden-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGhatkopar East, Mumbai\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.84 Cr to 7.11 Cr\n\n![Ajmera Greenfinity Wadala residential project in Wadala East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ajmera-greenfinity-wadala-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nWadala East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.08 Cr to 1.44 Cr\n\n![Ajmera Manhattan residential project in Bhakti Park](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ajmera-manhattan-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBhakti Park, Mumbai\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.16 Cr to 7.29 Cr\n\n![Ajmera Arha